  "sources": [
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "Energy Burst",
          "desc": "Basic Attacks reduce the cooldown of Skill 1."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "Rolling Raid",
          "desc": "Rolls in the target direction, granting extra range and a piercing effect to the next Basic Attack. Gains increased Movement Speed if there are enemy heroes nearby after rolling."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "Frag Grenade",
          "desc": "Throws a grenade at the target location, damaging, marking, and sundering hit enemies. Her Basic Attack deals extra damage to marked targets."
        },
        {
          "type": "Ultimate",
          "name": "Ultimate Shell",
          "desc": "Fires a shell in the target direction, dealing AoE damage when enemies are hit or when exploding at max range."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "pros": [
          "Great mobility",
          "Insane late-game",
          "Quick burst damage"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "Squishy",
          "Vulnerable to burst and crowd control",
          "Weak mid-game"
        ],
        "gameplay_tips": "## Early Game\nIn the early game, you want to farm safely before hitting your item spikes. The only time you should look to trade is when Skill 1 Rolling Raid is available. Learning the range of your empowered auto attack and where to roll will help you win every trade. You can also use Skill 1 defensively to escape ganks and dodge enemy skill shots. Try to hit Skill 2 Frag Grenade before going in, helping you land your empowered basic attack and deal more damage.\n\n## Teamfights\nAs a marksman, make sure to stay behind your frontline. Be careful when using Skill 1. If you roll forward and get caught, you will have no mobility to escape. Remember you can roll over walls to reposition in fights. With your increased range from Skill 1, try to burst high-priority targets like the enemy's marksman or mage. \n\n## Tips & Tricks\nSkill 1 can be used to roll over walls to chase enemies or escape danger\nUse Skill 2 before your burst, the slow makes it harder for enemies to escape\n\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "1) Assassin masuk pas Lady Sun salah posisi atau udah pakai dash. 2) Dia lincah banget, tunggu momen buat control baru bunuh."
    },
